    "conclusion": "In this simulation 10 read replicas served 10.3x the reads of one primary while the write ceiling fell (2000 to 1667 writes/s), reading your own write back was stale 3.3% of the time at 50 ms lag and 51.9% at 500 ms, about the same for 1, 3 or 10 replicas, and two primaries with last-write-wins silently lost 9.5% of writes at 50 ms lag.",
